    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0207" n="183" sameAs="frus:frus1864p4/pg183"/>

                <head>Mr. Nelson to Señor Don A. Covarrubias.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Santiago de Chili,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 11, 1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of a note from your excellency, dated this day, informing me that his excellency
                    the President of the republic, having accepted the resignation of the honorable
                    Señor Don Manuel A. Tocornal as minister of foreign relations, has been pleased
                    to appoint your excellency to that high and honorable position.</p>
                <p>Allow me to respond cordially to the hopes expressed by your excellency, and to
                    manifest the earnest desire that our official relations may be such as may tend
                    to strengthen the friendly relations happily subsisting between the United
                    States and the republic of Chili.</p>
                <p>In tendering to your excellency my earnest congratulations upon your elevation to
                    a position so responsible, I have the honor to offer to your excellency the
                    assurances of most distinguised consideration with which I am your excellency’s
                    most obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>THOMAS H. NELSON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor Don <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvaro Covarrubias</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister of Foreign Relations of the Republic of
                            Chili.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
